<h1>Chase Points to United Miles Calculator</h1>
<p class="sub">Calculate exact United MileagePlus miles received from Chase Ultimate Rewards® points. Real-time 1:1 transfer calculator, 1,000-point increment enforcement, and award value analysis.</p>

<div class="direct-answer">
  <strong>Direct Answer:</strong> Chase Ultimate Rewards® transfer to United MileagePlus® at a <strong>1:1 ratio in increments of 1,000 points</strong> (1,000 Chase points = 1,000 United miles) with a minimum transfer threshold of 1,000 points. Transfers are typically instant and incur no transfer fees or excise taxes. Transferred points cannot be returned to Chase.
</div>

